Attribute for setting any enum property as custom title with an aditional varriable. 
Do note to set the defaultValue to what ever the attribute default value is [BaseContainerProps(), BaseContainerCustomEnumWithValue(EEditorMode, "m_Mode", "m_iValue", "2")]
